>In the midst of this, he is summoned by \u201cMisumi\u201d who has been secretly conducting research in an underground area, and asked to participate in a project involving the mysterious \u201cMorsomnia\u201d a different space, as a change of pace.<br><br>\u201cMorsomnia\u201dis also related to \u201cArcana\u201d an unidentified whale-like creature that I was previously involved in investigating. When I opened the blue door to the underground area, I found a life form with a will that called itself\u201cKuon\u201d made of cells and pieces of meat taken from Arcana, waiting there.",
